{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/Steam_separator.png?t=1749303388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/Puzzle.gif?t=1749303388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way through a\u00a0dense forest, solving puzzles based on loading parts of the game. Special loading torches and you \u2014 the player character \u2014 help keep the world stable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/Steam_blank_separator.png?t=1749303388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/Steam_separator2.png?t=1749303388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/Character-246.png?t=1749303388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the <strong>Northuldra</strong> inhabitants. When the world suddenly shuts down, having been dropped from the device's memory, they cannot move. Therefore, they will need your help.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/Steam_blank_separator.png?t=1749303388\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754760/extras/Steam_separator3.png?t=1749303388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is non-linear: each solved puzzle opens up new parts of the game to explore. Navigate through the world's unloaded tiles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754760?t=1749303388","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite